---
// The reinforcement learning loop.
import ArrowDef from '../components/ArrowDef.astro';
---
<svg class="fig" viewBox="0 0 700 220" role="img" aria-labelledby="rl-title rl-desc">
  <title id="rl-title">The reinforcement learning loop</title>
  <desc id="rl-desc">A policy receives an observation and outputs an action. The environment, usually a simulator, applies the action and returns the next observation and a reward. The learning algorithm adjusts the policy to make actions that led to high reward more likely.</desc>
  <defs><ArrowDef id="ah-rl" /></defs>
  <rect class="soft1 c1" stroke-width="1.4" x="60" y="60" width="200" height="90" rx="12" /><text x="160" y="96" text-anchor="middle" class="t-strong">Policy</text><text x="160" y="116" text-anchor="middle" class="t-small">a neural network:</text><text x="160" y="132" text-anchor="middle" class="t-small">observation → action</text>
  <rect class="soft3 c3" stroke-width="1.4" x="440" y="60" width="200" height="90" rx="12" /><text x="540" y="96" text-anchor="middle" class="t-strong">Environment</text><text x="540" y="116" text-anchor="middle" class="t-small">a simulator, or the</text><text x="540" y="132" text-anchor="middle" class="t-small">real robot and world</text>
  <path class="wire" d="M260 86 H438" marker-end="url(#ah-rl)" /><text x="350" y="78" text-anchor="middle" class="t-small t-strong">action</text><text x="350" y="100" text-anchor="middle" class="t-small t-muted">joint targets or torques</text>
  <path class="wire" d="M440 130 H262" marker-end="url(#ah-rl)" /><text x="350" y="148" text-anchor="middle" class="t-small t-strong">observation + reward</text><text x="350" y="164" text-anchor="middle" class="t-small t-muted">joint angles, IMU… and one number: how well it is doing</text>
  <path class="c2" fill="none" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-dasharray="6 4" d="M540 150 V196 H160 V152" marker-end="url(#ah-rl)" /><text x="350" y="212" text-anchor="middle" class="t-small t-c2">learning algorithm: make high-reward actions more likely</text>
  <text x="350" y="30" text-anchor="middle" class="t-small t-muted">Repeated millions to billions of times. Nobody tells the policy what the right action was.</text>
</svg>
